### Football Federation Hub — REST Client / Postman Collection
### You can run these directly in VS Code (with REST Client extension) or import into Postman.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api
@token = dev-token

### ============================================================
### 1. HEALTH & SYSTEM
### ============================================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5001/health

### Root API Map
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Reset Database to Clean Seed Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/reset-seed

### ============================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================================

### Get Demo Accounts List
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-accounts

### Login as Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@federation.org",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "scout@football.org",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Federation Scout"
}

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 3. CLUBS (POST & GET)
### ============================================================

### GET All Clubs
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET Club by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs/club-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Create New Club (Inserts to Database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clubs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Dire Dawa City FC",
  "shortName": "Dire Dawa",
  "city": "Dire Dawa",
  "country": "Ethiopia",
  "foundedYear": 1982,
  "status": "active"
}


### ============================================================
### 4. PLAYERS (POST & GET)
### ============================================================

### GET All Players
GET {{baseUrl}}/players?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Create New Player
POST {{baseUrl}}/players
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Dawit",
  "lastName": "Fikru",
  "nationality": "Ethiopian",
  "position": "Forward",
  "dateOfBirth": "2001-05-14",
  "gender": "male",
  "currentClubId": "club-1",
  "status": "active"
}


### ============================================================
### 5. REGISTRATIONS & LICENSING (POST & GET)
### ============================================================

### GET All Registrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Submit Player Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "playerId": "plr-1",
  "clubId": "club-1",
  "seasonId": "season-2024-25",
  "jerseyNumber": 10
}

### PATCH Approve Registration
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/registrations/reg-1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "notes": "All identity and medical documents verified."
}


### ============================================================
### 6. TRANSFERS (POST & GET)
### ============================================================

### GET All Transfers
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Initiate Transfer Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "playerId": "plr-2",
  "fromClubId": "club-2",
  "toClubId": "club-1",
  "transferType": "permanent",
  "transferFee": 75000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "contractUntil": "2027-06-30"
}

### PATCH Approve Transfer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transfers/trf-1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "notes": "Approved by federation transfer officer."
}


### ============================================================
### 7. MATCHES & LIVE EVENTS (POST & GET)
### ============================================================

### GET All Matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Schedule New Match
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "competitionId": "comp-1",
  "seasonId": "season-2024-25",
  "homeTeamId": "team-1",
  "awayTeamId": "team-2",
  "matchDate": "2026-10-25",
  "venue": "Addis Ababa Stadium"
}

### POST Add Goal Event (Updates Match Score in DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/match-1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventType": "goal",
  "minute": 42,
  "teamId": "team-1",
  "playerId": "plr-1"
}


### ============================================================
### 8. DASHBOARD & STANDINGS (GET)
### ============================================================

### GET League Standings
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions/comp-1/standings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET Federation Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
